//! The `border-image-slice` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property divides
//! the image specified by `border-image-source` into regions. These regions form the components of
//! an element's [border
//! image](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/border-image).
//!
//! Initial: 100%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the size of the border image.
//!
//! Grammar: [<number [0,∞]> | <percentage [0,∞]>]{1,4} && fill?
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-borders-4/#propdef-border-image-slice
